          "text": "Ī shakoolechiwa sha makanza ga mhīndī na ga dilū īsho winhagwa sha ng'hana ī shenīsho, gwike shibambīlage ī shakoolechiwa shenīsho, nguno ī shoi sha kū shikū ja kūle kū būtongi.",
