        {
          "text": "Ū nene Danyeli nakanoga no, nūlaala mu būlīīlī nalī nsaatu ikanza lya shikū būlebe. Hanuma ya henaho nūbūūka nandya hangī ī milīmo ya ntemi. Shikanikamaaja no ī shakoolechiwa, shalī shinikīlile ū witegelegeje.",
